14	// projection (llm_attn_qkv, the plain arm of llm_gemm.comp) and all three end
15	// in the same layout — so the grid is simply "one (token tile, plane)" and the
16	// plane index says which of the three this workgroup is.
17	//
18	//	plane < heads                   query head p        norm, rope, scale
19	//	plane < heads + kvHeads         key head p-heads    norm, rope
20	//	otherwise                       value head          neither
